          "text": "KUEI Chuang 歸莊 (T. 玄恭, 元公, 懸公, 園公, H. 恆軒, 普明頭陀, 歸妹, 歸乎來), Aug. 29, 1613–1673, Oct. 1, a native of K'un-shan, Kiangsu, was a great-grandson of the Ming teacher and prose writer, Kuei Yu-kuang 歸有光 (T. 熙甫, H. 震川, 1506–1571).",
